# Content model

Public site is **not** assembled from the page-component tree. Typed entities:

| Entity | Role |
|---|---|
| `ingest_items` | Raw imported sources (stage 1+); not public |
| `posts` | All public content after materialize |
| `events` | Legacy admin table only; public invitations are posts |
| `appearances` | Press / v tisku |

## Sections

| Code | Czech | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ritualy` | Svatební rituály | `/svatebni-ritualy` | Business portfolio — weddings / bridal only |
| `umeni` | Umění | `/umeni` | Discrete art objects / commissions / gallery installations only |
| `denik` | Deník | `/denik` | Dated journal — diary, portraits, workshops, reports, seasonal notes, the rest |
| `udalosti` | Události | `/udalosti` | Current **invitations** only (ephemeral detail URLs) |

Invitations are primarily the **homepage hero** (“Připoj se”). Nav is rituály · deník · umění · kontakt. Legacy `himmelhaus` / `workshopy` redirect to `/denik`.

`Section::work()` (homepage plots) = deník → rituály → umění (rituály centered in the three-column row).

## Controlled tags

| Tag | Meaning | Public fate |
|---|---|---|
| `invitation` | Open call to an upcoming/current event | Current → `/udalosti/…` + homepage hero; **past** → lasting `denik` (invitation tag dropped on the public post) |
| `report` | Lasting write-up of an event that already happened | lasting `denik` |

Mutually exclusive. LLM fills via KeywordAnalyzer; allowlist in `App\Classes\Content\Tags`. Past vs current is decided at materialize from `endsAt` / start day (see `PostMaterializer::isPastInvitation`).

## Homepage

Visual layout is in `homepage.mdc`. Featured text/photos: current invitation, else latest lasting work post. Then three plots: Rituály → Umění → Deník.

## Materialize mapping

- `invitation` + event still current → `udalosti` (ephemeral)
- `invitation` + event already past → `denik` (lasting; no public `invitation` tag)
- `kind=wedding` → `ritualy`
- `kind=installation` → `umeni` (named art object / commission only — not seasonal diary or portraits)
- everything else lasting (incl. `portrait`, workshop, report) → `denik`

## Post parts (`layoutJson.parts`)

Public body is an ordered list in `posts.layoutJson.parts` (`text` / `image` / `gallery`). See `App\Classes\Content\PostParts`. Rematerialize: `MaterializePosts --args='{"existingOnly":true}'`.

## Import

Load into ingest via Katu jobs first (see `ingest.mdc`). Public `posts` come from `MaterializePosts`, not refresh jobs.
